------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 Goblin cuts in
Text=Quiet child, and finish eating.  You've only eaten five meals today.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=21 Goblin cuts in
Text=You, traveler, what concern is this of yours?  For your sake, I suggest you continue on your way and simply pretend that you never saw us here.  
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What are your plans for this girl?
Go to node ID=20 feast

Requirement=ST 8+
Reply Text=<Say nothing. Step over him, pick the child up, and look down.> Try.
Go to node ID=71 backs down
Custom Action=CGiveExperiencePointsToAllPlayersAction
{
Get XP Frome=Saved woodcutter's daughter though speech
Experience Points To Add=1
}
Icon=Attribute Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Free the girl immediately, Goblin.
Go to node ID=25 Goblin says no
Icon=Fight Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I was never here, and neither were you. I am walking away now.
Go to node ID=52 goblin lets you go
