Node ID=20 feast
Text=If you must know, she will be the most succulent course at our upcoming feast.  There is no finer culinary delight than the sweet flesh of a young child.  I warn you - if you interfere, we shall feed your tough, aged flesh to our slaves.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Goblin Horde IS
Reply Text=I carry the Khan's favour, and I am taking this child to him. Argue, and he will hear about that instead.
Go to node ID=73 the handover
Custom Action=CGiveExperiencePointsToAllPlayersAction
{
Get XP Frome=Saved woodcutter's daughter though speech
Experience Points To Add=1
}
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=Goblin Horde NOT
Reply Text=The Khan would want to know who fed him this well. Hand her to me and tell him my name with yours.
Go to node ID=74 a way in
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What would you take for her? Everything has a price.
Go to node ID=40 goblin offers trade

