Node ID=40 goblin offers trade
Text=As I do not see a younger, fatter child in your company, there is no trade that will be acceptable to me.  You see, a child such as this is a true delicacy.  Now, the choice is yours.  Leave in peace, or be part of the meal yourself.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Barter moreequal 55
Reply Text=A delicacy you will eat once. I am offering you a season of them - salt pork, twice your weight, waiting at the Crossroads under my name. Refuse that and you are not a gourmet, you are simply hungry.
Go to node ID=72 the trade
Custom Action=CGiveExperiencePointsToAllPlayersAction
{
Get XP Frome=Saved woodcutter's daughter though speech
Experience Points To Add=1
}
